<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CyberOptics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CyberOptics.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co analyst Dan Klesken raised his rating on CyberOptics to Buy from Long-Term Attractive.</p>
<p>Klesken said the outlook for surface mount technology inspection using CyberOptics' Sentry systems is showing signs of increasing demand and that the market is in the early stages of a capacity expansion.</p>
<p>Given the improved outlook in product demand, Klesken is raising his EPS estimates from $0.50 to $0.55 for F1997 and from $0.80 to $0.90 for F1998, and upgrading the stock to a Buy from Long term attractive.</p>
</text>
